      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "용건이 있어요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C6A9AC74C7740020C788C5B4C694002E00100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "시간 있으시면\n포켓몬 연구소로 와 주세요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2DCAC040020C788C73CC2DCBA74000AD3ECCF13BAAC0020C5F0AD6CC18CB85C0020C6400020C8FCC138C694002E00100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0003>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 316,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00030000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "와 줘서 고마워요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 328,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C6400020C918C11C0020ACE0B9C8C6CCC694002E00100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "제가 무슨 일로 불렀는지\n아시겠나요?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 360,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C81CAC000020BB34C2A80020C77CB85C0020BD88B800B294C9C0000AC544C2DCACA0B098C694003F00100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "모르겠는데요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 412,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BAA8B974ACA0B294B370C6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그냥 가르쳐 주세요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B0E50020AC00B974CCD00020C8FCC138C6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "흠!\n참 싱거운 대답이네요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D7600021000ACC380020C2F1AC70C6B40020B300B2F5C774B124C694002E00100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아무튼... 제가 당신을 부른 이유는\n전임자에게 부탁받은 일 때문이에요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 492,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C544BB34D2BC002E002E002E0020C81CAC000020B2F9C2E0C7440020BD80B9780020C774C720B294000AC804C784C790C5D0AC8C0020BD80D0C1BC1BC7400020C77C0020B54CBB38C774C5D0C694002E00100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "재미있는 트레이너를 만나게 되면\n포켓몬을 맡겨 주라고 했거든요.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n그리고 제 기준에 당신은\n재미있는 트레이너구요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 584,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C7ACBBF8C788B2940020D2B8B808C774B108B97C0020B9CCB098AC8C0020B418BA74000AD3ECCF13BAACC7440020B9E1ACA80020C8FCB77CACE00020D588AC70B4E0C694002E00100001BE01000AADF8B9ACACE00020C81C0020AE30C900C5D00020B2F9C2E0C740000AC7ACBBF8C788B2940020D2B8B808C774B108AD6CC694002E00100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 70
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그런데 당신은 지금\n포켓몬을 받을 수 없는 모양이네요.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n박스를 정리하고 다시 와 주시겠어요?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 724,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7F0B3700020B2F9C2E0C7400020C9C0AE08000AD3ECCF13BAACC7440020BC1BC7440020C2180020C5C6B2940020BAA8C591C774B124C694002E00100001BE00000ABC15C2A4B97C0020C815B9ACD558ACE00020B2E4C2DC0020C6400020C8FCC2DCACA0C5B4C694003F00100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 59
    },
    {
      "displayText": "포켓몬들아, 나오렴.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 844,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D3ECCF13BAACB4E4C544002C0020B098C624B834002E00100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "자!\n골라 보세요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 876,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C7900021000AACE8B77C0020BCF4C138C694002E00100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "불꽃타입 포켓몬\n파이리예요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 908,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BD88AF43D0C0C7850020D3ECCF13BAAC000AD30CC774B9ACC608C694002E00100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "물타입 포켓몬\n꼬부기예요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 948,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BB3CD0C0C7850020D3ECCF13BAAC000AAF2CBD80AE30C608C694002E00100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "풀타입 포켓몬\n이상해씨예요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 988,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D480D0C0C7850020D3ECCF13BAAC000AC774C0C1D574C528C608C694002E00100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "포켓몬을 고르셔야죠!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1028,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D3ECCF13BAACC7440020ACE0B974C154C57CC8E0002100100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>ā<U+0002><U+0010><U+0002>ᤀ<U+0005>로 하시겠어요?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 9,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1060,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002010100020010000219000005B85C0020D558C2DCACA0C5B4C694003F00100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "네!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1104,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B12400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "더 생각해 볼게요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1112,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B3540020C0DDAC01D5740020BCFCAC8CC6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "제 기준으로 재미있는 트레이너시니\n<U+0010><U+0002>ā<U+0002>에게<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n다양한 경험을 시켜 주실 거라 믿겠어요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1132,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C81C0020AE30C900C73CB85C0020C7ACBBF8C788B2940020D2B8B808C774B108C2DCB2C8000A0010000201010002C5D0AC8C00100001BE00000AB2E4C591D55C0020ACBDD5D8C7440020C2DCCF1C0020C8FCC2E40020AC70B77C0020BBFFACA0C5B4C694002100100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
